    value: <style=title><size=32>SCATTER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: <style=title><size=32>MISS CHINA</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_10
    value: '<size=16>3 Scatters triggers the Free Games bonus.

      Scatter appears on reels 1, 3, and 5 only.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=18>Substitutes for all symbols \nexcept Scatter."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_EXTRA_BET
    value: <style=title><size=42>EXTRA BET</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_EXTRA_BET
    value: "<size=24>- 50% of Line Bet is added as Extra Bet to activate Miss China
      Feature \n   and Miss China Nudge Feature."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_MISS_CHINA_FEATURE
    value: <style=title><size=42>MISS CHINA FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_MISS_CHINA_FEATURE
    value: '<size=24>- Full stack of Miss China symbols on reel 1 triggers 3 locked
      re-spins.

      - Reel 1 stays locked while re-spins occur in 16 individual spots in reels 2-5.

      - Only Miss China, Jackpot, or Blank symbols appear in the individual spots.

      - Receiving at least 1 Miss China and/or Jackpot awards one extra re-spin.

      - Feature ends when no re-spins remain. Calculate and award pay.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_MISS_CHINA_NUDGE
    value: <style=title><size=42>MISS CHINA NUDGE FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_MISS_CHINA_NUDGE
    value: "<size=24>- When 3 Miss China Symbols appear on reel 1, nudge the reel
      up or down \n   to create a full stack.\n- Full stack of Miss China triggers
      the Miss China feature."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: '<size=24>- 3 Scatters on reel 1, 3 and 5 triggers the Free Games bonus.

      - There is no free games re-trigger or Jackpot within free games.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOT_BONUS
    value: <style=title><size=42>NEW YEAR JACKPOT BONUS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOT_BONUS
    value: "<size=24>- Jackpot symbol only appears in the Miss China Feature.\n- Jackpots
      symbol triggers the Jackpot Picker Game.\n- Select Red Pockets to reveal one
      of 4 Jackpot coins: \n   Mini, Minor, Mega, or Grand.\n- Pick 3 or more of the
      same Jackpot coin to win \n   the Jackpot award."
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>50 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: INGAME_LEFT_BOTTOM_RESPIN_COUNT
    value: '<b><size=42><color=#fff94f>{0} of {1}</color></size>

      <size=28>RESPINS</size></b>'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: New Year Jackpot
